flowchart TD
    ENTRY[Client + API] --> CHECK[Temporal: validate + idempotency]
    CHECK --> INTENT[Create intent + save pending]
    INTENT --> WAIT[Wait signal]
    WAIT --> RESULT{Result?}
    RESULT -->|ok| PAID[Paid]
    RESULT -->|fail/timeout| FAILED[Failed]
    PAID --> ENTRY
    FAILED --> ENTRY
    CHECK --> KEY[Key store]
    INTENT --> STRIPE[Stripe]
    INTENT --> DB[DB]
    PAID --> DB
    FAILED --> DB
    STRIPE -.-> HOOK[Webhook]
    HOOK --> VERIFY[Verify sig]
    VERIFY --> WAIT
